{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"I’m building a fast, controller-first kitchen arcade game inspired by Pressure Cooker’s conveyor belts, precise burger orders, and escalating kitchen chaos. I’ll give it a cel-shaded 3D diner, a complete shift progression, and solo, co-op, and online play, then test the full loop.\n"}}
