{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"The kitchen now has three escalating shifts, timed tickets, ingredient stacks, delivery hatches, a dash, a rechargeable “time out” bell, and steam hazards. The visual and procedural audio systems are built; I’m connecting the menus and multiplayer, then checking controller navigation, touch assistance, and a complete three-shift playthrough.\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > Short-Order-Fever-Pressure-Cooker-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261105-221659/style.css <<'EOF'\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@500;600;700;800;900&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');\n:root{--ink:#243436;--cream:#fff4da;--muted:#a9b4a4;--orange:#f17a50;--green:#244c46;--yellow:#f7ce73;--ticket:#f87963;color-scheme:dark;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif}*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#173b37;color:var(--cream)}body{user-select:none}button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit}button{cursor:pointer;touch-action:manipulation}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:4px solid var(--yellow);outline-offset:4px}#game{display:block;position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;touch-action:none}#shade{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(18,43,39,.96) 0%,rgba(18,43,39,.94) 29%,rgba(18,43,39,.64) 48%,rgba(18,43,39,.05) 77%)}.hidden{display:none\"'!important}.panel{position:absolute;left:5.5%;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:min(560px,43vw);max-height:92vh;overflow:auto;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:#657b69 transparent;padding:15px 8px 18px 0}h1,h2,h3,.condensed{font-family:'\"'Barlow Condensed',Impact,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase}h1{font-size:clamp(60px,7.65vw,132px);font-weight:900;line-height:.81;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:24px 0 20px;color:var(--cream);text-shadow:3px 5px 0 #0b2824}h1 em{display:block;color:var(--yellow);font-style:normal}h2{font-size:clamp(36px,4.1vw,66px);font-weight:800;line-height:.95;margin:18px 0 24px;letter-spacing:-.015em}h3{font-size:27px;letter-spacing:.025em;margin:17px 0 10px}.eyebrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:clamp(12px,1.05vw,17px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.22em;color:va